    "section": "06",
    "title": "书签没有替你回答",
    "personalRoute": "claude",
    "bg": "library_reading_day",
    "music": "B11",
    "who": "narration",
    "text": "你笑起来。她低头喝茶，杯沿藏住了嘴角，却没有藏住她看向你的目光。",
    "char": null,
    "progress": 27,
