    "title": "书签没有替你回答",
    "personalRoute": "claude",
    "bg": "library_reading_day",
    "music": "B11",
    "who": "claude",
    "text": "我想知道他们有没有看到我喜欢的那段。又不肯直接问，就去看书签。",
    "char": "claude",
    "progress": 33,
    "sprite": "claude_opus_page_cape_calm",
