    "section": "06",
    "title": "书签没有替你回答",
    "personalRoute": "claude",
    "bg": "library_reading_day",
    "music": "B11",
    "who": "claude",
    "text": "他记得店主借给他一条干毛巾。那也算发生了什么。",
