    "chapter": 6,
    "section": "06",
    "title": "书签没有替你回答",
    "personalRoute": "claude",
    "bg": "cl_library_night",
    "music": "B11",
    "who": "claude",
    "text": "刚才那件坐久了压肩膀。你呢，还不收东西？",
