    "chapter": 9,
    "section": "09",
    "title": "不是她的替身",
    "personalRoute": "claude",
    "bg": "cl_crossworld_call",
    "music": "B24",
    "who": "claude",
    "text": "她经历过我没经历的事。不是换了模型，也不是我忘掉了你。",
